    "location": "html-block:38",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:39",
    "text": "Our Micro820® programmable logic controllers (PLC) include a nano-sized footprint and are designed for small standalone machine control and remote automation applications that require flexible communications and I/O capabilities. These controllers support up to 36 I/O points with many embedded features such as Ethernet, microSD slot for recipe and data log, and analog I/O.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:40",
    "text": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:41",
    "text": "Optimize operational processes with the new Micro820 L20E controllers. These latest controller options offer additional capabilities that simplify machine development and deployment.",
    "heading": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:42",
    "text": "Enhanced performance on program execution, I/O response and communication",
    "heading": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:43",
    "text": "Increased connectivity with Class 1 implicit messaging up to four nodes",
    "heading": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:44",
    "text": "Simplified initial machine setup with a USB Type C port",
    "heading": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:45",
    "text": "Optimized for Connected Components Workbench™ software version 23 or FactoryTalk® Design Workbench™ software version 1 as the minimum requirement",
    "heading": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:46",
    "text": "Easy recognition of new controller options with catalog numbers containing E, for Ethernet connectivity, after the controller series. For example: 2080-L20E",
    "heading": "What’s New?"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:47",
    "text": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:48",
    "text": "Offers 20-point controllers",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:49",
    "text": "Provides embedded 0...10V non-isolated four channel analog input and one channel analog output for speed control of an AC drive",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:50",
    "text": "Provides embedded communications via non-isolated serial port (for RS-232 and RS-485 communications) and Ethernet port",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:51",
    "text": "Communicates via EtherNet/IP™",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:52",
    "text": "Provides embedded support for up to four 10k thermistor temperature inputs",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:53",
    "text": "Supports program download through USB with an optional 3.5-in. Remote LCD",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:54",
    "text": "Supports up to two Micro800™ plug-in modules",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:55",
    "text": "Supports microSD™ card for program transfer, datalog, and recipe management",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:56",
    "text": "Control Engineering 2026 Product of the Year and Plant Engineering 2026 Product of the Year",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:57",
    "text": "Micro820 L20E controller received Silver for both awards in the Industrial Computing category and Automation, Controls & Motion Systems category, respectively.",
    "heading": "Overview"
  },
  {
